<li id="bib.bib33" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Yang et al. (2018)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhilin Yang, Peng Qi, Saizheng Zhang, Yoshua Bengio, William W. Cohen, Ruslan Salakhutdinov, and Christopher D. Manning. 2018.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1809.09600" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Hotpotqa: A dataset for diverse, explainable multi-hop question answering</a>.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib33.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Preprint</em>, arXiv:1809.09600.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib34" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhang et al. (2022)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Zhuosheng Zhang, Aston Zhang, Mu Li, and Alex Smola. 2022.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03493" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_href">Automatic chain of thought prompting in large language models</a>.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib34.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Preprint</em>, arXiv:2210.03493.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib35" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zhao et al. (2024)</span>
